# Large torpedo: devastating if it lands, slow and expensive. 6.0 hp makes it a
# point-defense CHECK -- standard PD needs most of a second of beam time, so it
# punishes drained capacitors and HOLD stances. Counter it early or dodge hard.
id          heavy_torpedo
name        "Heavy Torpedo"
kind        missile
size        L
icon        ic-missile
damage      120
reload      9.0
proj_speed  5000
proj_life   16
proj_radius 8.0
cap_cost    45
emission    1.0
proj_hp     6.0
price       2600
tier        2
# Tactical range (autopilot approach / ROE acquisition / HUD ring); flight reach stays
# proj_speed x proj_life (80k).
engage_range 70000
# Ponderous cold launch: a heavy round shoved slowly out of the tube, a full second of
# silent coast, then the motor lights. Menace, not snap.
eject_speed  180
ignition_delay 1.0
desc "Slow, blazing-hot, and nearly unstoppable once inside terminal range. Point-defense needs most of a second of beam time to burn one down."
